# Build context hygiene for Dockerfile.web (CI-only builds). Secrets and
# machine-local state must NEVER reach an image layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
.github
.context
.claude
agent_handoff
# Docs never ship in the image — excluding them keeps the COPY layer
# cache-stable across docs-only pushes (session wraps rebuilt an identical
# app for ~5min before this). Root-level *.md only, DELIBERATELY: the
# proprietary/prompts/*.md prompt files DO ship and must invalidate the
# build when they change.
docs
*.md
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-dev
**/.data
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
